	myDescription "aurabesh = false, branch = \"MAIN\", contextComment = \"Sabacc ruleset panel content 03 - Cheats category\nText describing the differents cheats in sabacc, here the double draw\", enabled = true, guid = #E52E0D4365B23075000216A5FE9DF566, lineVersion = 11, maxLength = 0, productId = -1, sectionId = 9975, text = \"You can try to cheat and <b>draw 2 cards instead of one</b> from any deck, as long as there are <b>at least 2 cards in it</b>.\nYou can keep the <b>cheated hidden card as long as you want</b> during a game, <b>swap it</b> anytime with one in your hand, or choose to <b>double discard to get rid off it</b>.\nFailing this cheat will <b>increase opponents' suspicion</b>.\", type = \"MenuLine\"}"
